<div class="story-box">
    <h2>Book 4: Goblet of Fire</h2>
    <img class="story-banner" src="https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/qghficsimjkaeibhfztnpjrqiezhzuadzsjxwpnxusefbthfes/images/4/4a/35FFD453-DFDD-4C2C-93C2-FDE66CCB14D6.webp/revision/latest/thumbnail/width/360/height/450?cb=20210812224339" alt="Goblet of Fire">
    <p class="story-body">Hogwarts plays host to the historic Triwizard Tournament, a dangerous competition between rival magical schools. Though he is underage, Harry's name is mysteriously drawn from the magical Goblet of Fire, forcing him to battle dragons, rescue friends from the deep lake, and navigate a living maze that leads to a terrifying trap.</p>
